{#
  The decision after the author answered a copyright claim, to the author.

  The answer page tells them "we will tell you what was decided", and this is
  that mail. Sent for every decision recorded after the answer, the way the
  claimant hears of every decision; the statement of reasons went out once,
  before the answer, and is not sent again.

  @see docs/specs/content-reports.md §7
#}
{% extends 'emails/_base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}About your answer to a copyright claim{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
  <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Hello {{ author.displayName }},</p>

  <p style="margin:0 0 8px">You answered a copyright claim about something you added to Cycling Commons. A curator has read the claim and your answer, and decided.</p>

  <table role="presentation" style="margin:18px 0;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 14px 4px 0;color:#595c4d;vertical-align:top">What</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0">{{ report.targetType.label|trans }}{% if report.targetLabel %}: {{ report.targetLabel }}{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 14px 4px 0;color:#595c4d;vertical-align:top">Outcome</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0"><strong>{{ report.status.label|trans }}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:4px 14px 4px 0;color:#595c4d;vertical-align:top">Reference</td>
      <td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:monospace">{{ report.id }}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  {% if report.decisionNote %}
    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#595c4d;font-size:13px">What the curator wrote:</p>
    <blockquote style="margin:0 0 14px;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #8fb6a8;background:#f4efe3">{{ report.decisionNote|nl2br }}</blockquote>
  {% endif %}

  {% if report.status.value == 'upheld' %}
    <p style="margin:0 0 8px">The claim stands, so what was removed stays removed.</p>
  {% elseif report.status.value == 'rejected' %}
    {% if report.targetType.value == 'photo' %}
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px">We no longer agree with the claim. The photo cannot come back by itself, because its files were deleted when the claim was upheld. Upload it again and it is reviewed like any other photo.</p>
    {% else %}
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px">We no longer agree with the claim, so what was changed or removed because of it can be put back.</p>
    {% endif %}
  {% elseif report.status.value == 'moot' %}
    <p style="margin:0 0 8px">There was nothing left to decide, so the claim is closed.</p>
  {% endif %}

  <p style="margin:0 0 8px">A curator decided this, as a person. No machine made this decision.</p>

  {% if report.status.value != 'rejected' %}
    {% if reply_to|default(null) %}
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px"><strong>If we got it wrong, tell us.</strong> Reply to this email with the reference above and a person will read it again. You can also take it to an out-of-court dispute settlement body, or to a court, in the country where you live.</p>
    {% else %}
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px"><strong>If we got it wrong</strong>, you can take it to an out-of-court dispute settlement body, or to a court, in the country where you live.</p>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  <p style="color:#595c4d;font-size:13px;margin:0">- The Cycling Commons team</p>
{% endblock %}
